      "content": "While magnesium and melatonin can help with relaxation and sleep, they're unlikely to specifically address your vision symptoms. Magnesium has been linked to migraines, and taking high doses of magnesium can potentially trigger or worsen symptoms. Additionally, supplements can interact with medications or worsen underlying conditions. A more balanced approach would be to focus on managing your stress, getting regular exercise, and practicing good sleep habits, rather than relying solely on supplements.",
